'Students should be able to plan, create, edit, publish, and evaluate digital content for individuals, businesses, organisations, and online audiences.','video',7,'',
array['Plan content with a calendar','Shoot and edit short-form video','Grow and engage an audience','Read analytics and improve content']),
('general-digital-skills','General Digital Skills Acquisition','Essential computer, internet and productivity skills for beginners.','A foundational digital literacy programme for beginners who want to develop essential computer, internet, communication, productivity, and online work skills.','Complete beginners, job seekers and anyone preparing for specialist training.',
array['Introduction to computers and digital devices','Basic computer and smartphone operations','Operating systems and file management','Internet browsing and online research','Email creation and professional communication','Microsoft Word','Microsoft Excel','Microsoft PowerPoint','Google Workspace','Cloud storage and file sharing','Online collaboration and virtual meetings','Digital communication and professional etiquette','Cybersecurity and online privacy','Password security and phishing awareness','Online applications and digital forms','Digital payments and online transaction safety','Remote work and introductory freelancing','Online productivity tools','Digital entrepreneurship fundamentals'],
